    "description": "Pivot Energy develops, finances, builds, owns, and manages commercial, community-scale, and utility-oriented solar and energy storage projects in the United States. Its customers and counterparties include businesses, utilities, cooperatives, municipalities, community solar subscribers, and tax credit or capital providers. The platform operates as an asset-heavy independent power producer and developer, with contracted project revenues and development value rather than merchant retail power exposure. Public materials state that Pivot has nearly 1,900 projects completed or under development totaling more than 4 gigawatts of solar capacity nationwide. ECP acquired Pivot in June 2021, and the company has continued to expand under that ownership through project financing and new offtake arrangements.",
